<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle]，向我们发来了情报。附近矗立着一座鼠族城堡。这座城堡拥有坚固的城墙、高耸的塔楼和一些变节骑士护卫。[asker_nameDef]希望我们可以攻破城堡防线，消灭所有守卫。但要注意：敌人的增援很快就会到来。在攻陷城堡后，游击队将对周边进行解放工作并建立一个据点。</li>
  -->
  <RKU_OpportunitySite_CastleRaid.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has sent us intelligence. Nearby stands a Ratkin castle. This castle has sturdy walls, towering towers, and some renegade knights as guards. [asker_nameDef] hopes that we can breach the castle's defenses and eliminate all guards. But be warned: enemy reinforcements will arrive soon. After capturing the castle, the Partisans will carry out liberation work in the surrounding area and establish a base.</RKU_OpportunitySite_CastleRaid.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
